    "title": "Car Racing 3D: Racer Master",
    "description": "<b>Play Car Racing 3D: Racer Master for free, race against top racers worldwide in various stunt tracks,</b> drive a top class sports car, enjoy this addictive speed racing games on your mobile device anytime and anywhere. \r\n\r\n<b>Classic Racing Scenes</b>\r\nCar Racing 3D: Racer Master is a free stunt racing game for all racing game lovers. Many cars, challengeable racing missions, classic and eye-catching stunt scenes, enjoy this classical race master game, with easy control and full of fun. Train and act as a specially trained car racer, start your car engine, follow the call of missions, drive and drift to dodge various obstcles ahead. Enjoy this real car racing simulator game with so many classic scenes like Ice world, dessert, seaside and etc.\r\n\r\n<b>Addictive Racing Gameplay</b>\r\nPick up a sports car from garage, turbo racing drift on asphalt tracks, experience a thrilling racing battle. Offline car racing games are real racing games. Improve your driving skills, use racing skills once left behind. Get ready to collect more powerful props to upgrade your cars. Jump and dodge during the period of crossing obstcles, to avoid being destroyed by car crashing. Drift on all roads, to be a real race master car racing legend.\r\n\r\n<b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master</b> features:\r\n-Play this car racing game offline or online.\r\n-Enjoy addictive car racing gameplay with amazing sound effects.\r\n-Many realistic car racing missions wait for challenge.\r\n-Simple car racing control and drive freely in realistic 3D maps.\r\n-Complete car racing missions to get rewards, upgrade your favorite cars.\r\n-Provide classic car racing gameplay for free.\r\n-So many racing levels to challenge.\r\n\r\nMore features of Car Racing 3D: Racer Master will come soon:\r\n<b>Multiplayer mode</b> will be available soon.\r\n<b>World Tirp Racing</b> will be available soon.\r\n<b>World Ranking</b> will be available soon.\r\n\r\nPlay one of the best free car racing games with unlimited races. Explore all car racing maps one by one, conquer all stunt racing tracks, keep going, crown yourself as the race master once completing missions. <b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master </b> can provide all what you want, fierce squad battleground racing, real racing, drift in the tracks full of exciting challenges. Enjoy world class car racing matches in this non stop car racing games.\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download <b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master</b> now and have fun with your family and friends.\r\n\r\nStill worry about no wifi? Play this offline car racing game for free absolutely.\r\nAny feedback or suggestion on car racing is appreciated, please contact us via our Facebook Fanpage: \r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/CarRacing3DRacerMaster",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Play Car Racing 3D: Racer Master for free, race against top racers worldwide in various stunt tracks,</b> drive a top class sports car, enjoy this addictive speed racing games on your mobile device anytime and anywhere. <br><br><b>Classic Racing Scenes</b><br>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master is a free stunt racing game for all racing game lovers. Many cars, challengeable racing missions, classic and eye-catching stunt scenes, enjoy this classical race master game, with easy control and full of fun. Train and act as a specially trained car racer, start your car engine, follow the call of missions, drive and drift to dodge various obstcles ahead. Enjoy this real car racing simulator game with so many classic scenes like Ice world, dessert, seaside and etc.<br><br><b>Addictive Racing Gameplay</b><br>Pick up a sports car from garage, turbo racing drift on asphalt tracks, experience a thrilling racing battle. Offline car racing games are real racing games. Improve your driving skills, use racing skills once left behind. Get ready to collect more powerful props to upgrade your cars. Jump and dodge during the period of crossing obstcles, to avoid being destroyed by car crashing. Drift on all roads, to be a real race master car racing legend.<br><br><b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master</b> features:<br>-Play this car racing game offline or online.<br>-Enjoy addictive car racing gameplay with amazing sound effects.<br>-Many realistic car racing missions wait for challenge.<br>-Simple car racing control and drive freely in realistic 3D maps.<br>-Complete car racing missions to get rewards, upgrade your favorite cars.<br>-Provide classic car racing gameplay for free.<br>-So many racing levels to challenge.<br><br>More features of Car Racing 3D: Racer Master will come soon:<br><b>Multiplayer mode</b> will be available soon.<br><b>World Tirp Racing</b> will be available soon.<br><b>World Ranking</b> will be available soon.<br><br>Play one of the best free car racing games with unlimited races. Explore all car racing maps one by one, conquer all stunt racing tracks, keep going, crown yourself as the race master once completing missions. <b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master </b> can provide all what you want, fierce squad battleground racing, real racing, drift in the tracks full of exciting challenges. Enjoy world class car racing matches in this non stop car racing games.<br><br>What are you waiting for? Download <b>Car Racing 3D: Racer Master</b> now and have fun with your family and friends.<br><br>Still worry about no wifi? Play this offline car racing game for free absolutely.<br>Any feedback or suggestion on car racing is appreciated, please contact us via our Facebook Fanpage: <br>https://www.facebook.com/CarRacing3DRacerMaster",
